  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [css-loader](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader) from `v0.28.7` to `v0.28.10`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v0.28.8`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/releases/v0.28.8)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* **loader:** correctly check if source map is `undefined` ([#&#8203;641](`https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/issues/641`)) ([0dccfa9](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/0dccfa9))\n* proper URL escaping and wrapping (`url()`) ([#&#8203;627](`https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/issues/627`)) ([8897d44](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/8897d44))\n\n---\n\n### [`v0.28.9`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/releases/v0.28.9)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* ignore invalid URLs (`url()`) ([#&#8203;663](`https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/issues/663`)) ([d1d8221](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/d1d8221))\n\n---\n\n### [`v0.28.10`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/releases/v0.28.10)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* **getLocalIdent:** add `rootContext` support (`webpack >= v4.0.0`) ([#&#8203;681](`https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/issues/681`)) ([9f876d2](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/9f876d2))\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v0.28.8\n-   [`0840c80`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/0840c80cae606385ee00b043f996eccfaf78ee67) Fix markdown for link to webpack resolve.alias doc (#&#8203;595)\n-   [`7039740`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/7039740993d23d29a36860b459172d93ae1284c6) docs(README): add anchor tags to options table (#&#8203;609)\n-   [`c45fa66`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/c45fa664a23c422bed5a7bc10088b93f230f9bd6) test: add case for `url` processing (#&#8203;603)\n-   [`05c36db`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/05c36db29bfcdbb1a3da50a8f7b9a20dbd929721) test: removed redundant `modules` argument (#&#8203;599)\n-   [`d999f4a`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/d999f4a599b13e19d53fdd9fbd9a323fed7a101c) docs: Update importLoaders documentation (#&#8203;646)\n-   [`0dccfa9`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/0dccfa90b4962be57dc8227ef9ace61bc6bbe0b2) fix(loader): correctly check if source map is `undefined` (#&#8203;641)\n-   [`8897d44`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/8897d446c88eb7a6585a7954ae8766a7242c12da) fix: proper URL escaping and wrapping (`url()`) (#&#8203;627)\n-   [`39773aa`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/39773aa0ea5b1f972bb547110fa157a483074cc4) ci(travis): use `npm`\n-   [`333a2ce`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/333a2ce6b15179efd9f7c019082c54083520cc8c) chore(package): update `dependencies`\n-   [`0fc46c7`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/0fc46c791ce449a5e41cbe1af12eff8b74706053) chore(release): 0.28.8\n#### v0.28.9\n-   [`d1d8221`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/d1d8221d7602925f5243a002843febc458da8058) fix: ignore invalid URLs (`url()`) (#&#8203;663)\n-   [`604bd4b`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/604bd4b8af5c57f427e0ffa4f6c77dada67f27c1) chore(package): update dependencies\n-   [`630579d`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/630579d01e9d28a2032e707dcea2ad9f4ec613da) chore(release): 0.28.9\n#### v0.28.10\n-   [`0452f26`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/0452f267c2213d2ef55cdae0c63576adb7603024) test: hashes inside `@&#8203;font-face` url (#&#8203;678)\n-   [`9f876d2`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/9f876d27724081a33ac221d229e8bd90e112b345) fix(getLocalIdent): add `rootContext` support (`webpack &gt;&#x3D; v4.0.0`) (#&#8203;681)\n-   [`c35d8bd`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader/commit/c35d8bd12676662c01120acbc53e3ed3b2c59779) chore(release): 0.28.10\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
